{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202400","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120240001:1":{"text":"모두가 들었겠지만, 이제 나와 쿠긴이 결투를 할 예정이다.","source_cn":"各位，我想你们多半也听说了，接下来我和库金会进行一场公...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE35A777A847F5935","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120240002:1":{"text":"그리고 최후의 승자가 블랙하울의 족장이 될 것이다.","source_cn":"最后的胜者，可以继承黑嚎族长的位置。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40D8CFD9679088A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120240003:1":{"text":"소렌, 네가 족장 자리를 고사했다고 들었다. 블랙하울은 앞으로 너에게 아무런 요구도 하지 않을 거야.","source_cn":"索恩，库金和我说过你拒绝继承的事了。请放心，黑嚎不会再...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2040E808001CF071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120240004:1":{"text":"난 이제 크루거와의 결투를 준비하러 갈 거니까 부족 안을 자유롭게 둘러봐도 좋아.","source_cn":"接下来，我和克鲁格会去准备最后的战斗，你们可以在氏族内...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55233F5B598468EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120240005:1":{"text":"아, 그리고 너희에 대한 부족 사람들의 태도가 많이 달라졌어. 천천히 둘러봐… 우린 이만 가볼 테니.","source_cn":"另外，很多人对你们的态度已经改观了，你们可以去看看……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62735C90E3A3A6AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120240006:1":{"text":"음… 사실 블랙하울의 족장이 누가 되든 우리랑은 상관없긴 한데…","source_cn":"唔……虽说黑嚎的新族长是谁都和我们没关系……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0A34DE09F3AC8C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120240007:1":{"text":"쿠긴이랑 크루거 중에 승산이 더 있는 건 크루거겠지?","source_cn":"不过库金和克鲁格，果然还是克鲁格胜算更大些吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x045C57EFE88EC436","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120240008:1":{"text":"하지만 쿠긴은 오우거의 아들이라… 응원하는 사람들도 많을 거야, 그렇지?","source_cn":"但库金是奥格的子嗣……应该也会有很多支持者吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F491E35F33FBBFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120240009:1":{"text":"아르사, 이런 쪽에 관심이 있었어?","source_cn":"阿尔萨，原来你还对这些东西感兴趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x652715C5EEF17C23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120240010:1":{"text":"단순 호기심! 다들 군가 축제의 우승자가 궁금한 것처럼 나도 누구가 승산이 있는지 궁금하단 말이야!","source_cn":"单纯好奇嘛！就像那些人喜欢买战歌节的胜者一样，我也很想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF910368F7203AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120240011:1":{"text":"결투하려면 아직 시간이 있는데… 블랙하울 부족 사람들에게 물어볼까? 우리보다 잘 알 거 아냐!","source_cn":"距离决斗开始还有一段时间。要不……我们去找几个黑嚎族人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC8B275AFBFB822","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120240012:1":{"text":"…그래, 그럼. 난 피곤해서 좀 쉴게.","source_cn":"……你们去吧，我就不参与了，稍微有点累。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x083458DC8F5A143C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120240013:1":{"text":"알았어! 그럼 푹 쉬어. 이따 결투할 때 보자.","source_cn":"知道啦！那你先好好休息，之后决战的时候见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4729EAF033DA6AC5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120240014:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 고고고!","source_cn":"那就拜托<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9F54A055E20A1AB4","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 고고고!","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 고고고!","variant_male_record_index":"120032","variant_female_record_index":"120033","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:克鲁格":{"text":"크루거","source":"克鲁格","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:库金":{"text":"쿠긴","source":"库金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨",